    "scope": "all_incidents",
    "during_investigation_required": null,
    "phase_in_months": 0,
    "quote": "Manufacturers shall report any thermal incident involving fire, smoke, injury, emergency-service response, or property damage to the relevant regulator within 24 hours of learning of it, and provide a complete incident report within 10 calendar days. They shall notify affected customers within 48 hours when an incident indicates a material safety risk, and promptly provide relevant precautions and updates."
